ot  and there are more sleeper agents  perseus knows about vorkuta and is  definitely interested in these agents  expect to find some more information and  references to mason's brainwashing and  the numbers program  crossbow  kravchenko who was on the list of people  mason was supposed to kill  is also still alive previously you've  only encountered him in active war zones  but now you'll get a chance to see what  he's like in an office setting  when he's not physically trying to stomp  your face in he's definitely not going  to die however because that happens  later in the series that doesn't sound  too  soviet of you brother what we know about  cold war's plot  the main part of cold war takes place in  1981 which is 13 years after black ops 1  and the failure of the numbers program  but the soviet union hasn't given up  plotting to bring down america  and have infiltrated america's nuclear  programs however  cold war does not take place in america  and is almost entirely focused on cold  war europe as an alliance of  international spy agencies work to  thwart a new plot from russia  although mason woods and jason hudson  are in cold war  a cast of new characters are also  hunting perseus  including a cia officer named russell  adler lead writer murray kraft said that  players are supposed to question his  intentions and we know the game has  multiple endings so keep an eye on that  guy  expect to encounter him in the 1980s and  in a number of flashbacks  to learn what he was up to the other new  characters are eleazar or lazar from the  israel defense forces  helen park from mi6 and lawrence sims a  cia officer who was also in  the vietnam war you'll get to know these  characters not only through missions but  through talking to them  at the safe house the safe house also  seems to contain a lot of intel on black  ops 1  with files on deceased villain dragovich  references to the numbers program  snippets about the kennedy assassination  that mason may or may no